<section id="mil" class="mil-section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Media literacy in action</p>
    <h2>Built from UNESCO MIL values</h2>
    <p class="muted">Prova started from the UNESCO MIL Youth Hackathon 2025 and now enters the 2026 edition to show that verification can be as natural as scrolling.</p>
    <div class="mil-highlight">UNESCO MIL values, youth-first design, and everyday verification in the feed.</div>
    <div class="mil-grid">
      <div class="mil-card">
        <h4>Think critically</h4>
        <p>Quick prompts help youth pause, question sources, and check context before they share.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mil-card">
        <h4>Engage interactively</h4>
        <p>Peer-driven verification and gamified habits make media literacy feel social, not schoolwork.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mil-card">
        <h4>Protect inclusively</h4>
        <p>Accessible trust signals and friendly guidance help every young user feel safer online.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mil-card">
        <h4>Verify responsibly</h4>
        <p>Evidence, bias checks, and source context turn doubt into confident sharing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mil-details">
      <div>
        <h3>Supporting UNESCO MIL goals</h3>
        <p>We turn media and information literacy into everyday habits through prompts, community trust, and learning pathways.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Youth-powered verification</h3>
        <p>Community fact-checking makes Prova more than a tool: it’s a trusted social layer for young people who want real clarity.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mil-affiliations">
      <div class="mil-affiliation">
        <strong>2025</strong>
        <span>Started with the UNESCO Youth Hackathon journey</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mil-affiliation">
        <strong>2026</strong>
        <span>Now entering the UNESCO Youth Hackathon with renewed impact</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mil-affiliation">
        <strong>UNESCO MIL Alliance</strong>
        <span>Building media literacy into daily online habits</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mil-links">
      <a class="secondary-button" href="https://www.unesco.org/en/weeks/media-information-literacy/youth-hackathon-2025" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Youth Hackathon 2025</a>
      <a class="primary-button" href="https://www.unesco.org/en/articles/unesco-youth-hackathon-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Youth Hackathon 2026</a>
      <a class="secondary-button" href="https://www.unesco.org/en/media-information-literacy/alliance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">UNESCO MIL Alliance</a>
